BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Marty Supreme
DTSTART:20260104T031500Z
DTEND:20260104T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20260104T031500Z
UID:prxRjGOA3P
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 149 mins (2h29m)\n\nMarty Mauser\, a young man with 
 a dream no one respects\, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness. 
 From writer/director Josh Safdie and starring Timothée Chalamet\, Gwyneth
  Paltrow\, Odessa A'zion\, Kevin O'Leary\, Tyler Okonma\, Abel Ferrara\, a
 nd Fran Drescher. Three Golden Globe nominations including Best Motion Pi
 cture - Musical or Comedy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/mart
 y-supreme\n\nEstimated start: 19:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:No Other Choice
DTSTART:20260103T201500Z
DTEND:20260103T225000Z
DTSTAMP:20260103T201500Z
UID:cIeUCs3Nv0
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 139 mins (2h19m)\n\nIn his diabolical new thriller\,
  Park Chan-wook crafts a dark fable about the cutthroat nature of contempo
 rary work culture\, starring Lee Byung Hun as a husband and father who tak
 es violent action after being laid off.  From January 1 to 4\, all 7pm sh
 owtimes will be presented in 35mm. Free exclusive translucent mini posters
  available at these screenings while supplies last.\n\nhttps://www.siff.ne
 t/cinema/in-theaters/no-other-choice\n\nEstimated start: 12:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
